    {
      "text": "restore every man’s money into his sack, Gen. 42:25. Joseph gathered up all the money … in the land, Gen. 47:14. If thou lend money to any of my people that is poor, Ex. 22:25. thou shalt take the atonement money of the children of Israel, Ex. 30:16. shalt not give him thy money upon usury, Lev. 25:37. All the money of the dedicated things that is brought into the house of the Lord, 2 Kgs. 12:4. they saw that there was much money, 2 Chr. 24:11. money is a defence, Eccl. 7:12. money answereth all things, Eccl. 10:19. ye shall be redeemed without money, Isa. 52:3. he that hath no money; come ye, buy, and eat, Isa. 55:1–2 (2 Ne. 9:50–51). prophets thereof divine for money, Micah 3:11.",
